Z||000005||sluppy123||02-14-2001||08:01 PM||||I program a CNC machining center where I work, I can machine just about anything you can think of. A few weeks ago I was bored and made these, I plan to stick them on the under side of the deck lid. I could do the same thing with a ashtray door, If anyone has a extra pair laying around I could give it a shot.<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=11170243&p=40983593&Sequence=0"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=11170243&p=40983515&Sequence=0"> <P><BR><P>------------------<BR>-Brian, Toolmaker<BR>Lincoln, NE<BR>85' SC & 87' GT-Leather, Lowered, Nitrous<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=7653930&p=37756786&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||10
