Z||000016||sluppy123||02-17-2001||12:25 PM||||Haze- I could do that but I would need the EXACT dimensions of the glove box so the door would fit.<P>Mope- What kind of cad formats could be sent?(I can import DWG, wmf, sat, aps, 3ds.)<P>Fiero64- You could take a picture of the Pegasus logo and import it into a CAD program, then use it to find you Tangent points and program it by hand. Wouldn't be to hard.||||reg||1
